# Local scratch output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
/out/
*.local.json

# Reviewer / agent scratch directories. These hold throwaway CLI fixtures
# (IR JSON, generated VSDX, exported models) produced while verifying behaviour.
# They must never be committed: `git add -A` will otherwise sweep them in.
# Reviewer scratch dirs, one per review round. Use a pattern rather than listing
# each round: forgetting to add r5 is exactly how 297 files got committed once.
.review-scratch*/
.p9/
.lab/
.scratch/
*.review.json
